---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Filekrush"
  description="Filekrush terms of service. Free browser-based file tools provided as-is."
  canonical="/terms"
>
  <section class="max-w-[990px] mx-auto px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-[16px] mb-10" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Agreement</h2>
      <p>By using Filekrush (filekrush.com), you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site.</p>

      <h2>What Filekrush is</h2>
      <p>Filekrush provides free, browser-based file utility tools including image compression, resizing, format conversion, metadata viewing and removal, image-to-PDF conversion, and passport photo creation. All processing happens locally in your web browser.</p>

      <h2>No account required</h2>
      <p>Filekrush does not require registration, login, or any personal information to use. All tools are freely accessible.</p>

      <h2>Your files</h2>
      <p>Your files are processed entirely in your browser. Filekrush does not upload, transmit, store, or access your files in any way. You retain full ownership of all files you process using our tools. We have no ability to recover files once you close your browser tab.</p>

      <h2>Provided as-is</h2>
      <p>Filekrush tools are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the tools will meet specific requirements, produce specific results, or be error-free. Output quality depends on input file characteristics and selected settings.</p>

      <h2>Use at your own risk</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for verifying that output files meet your requirements before submitting them to any third party (government portals, employers, visa offices, etc.). Filekrush is not liable for rejected submissions, lost data, or any consequences arising from the use of our tools.</p>

      <h2>Passport photo disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The passport photo tool provides dimension presets based on publicly available government specifications. Filekrush does not guarantee that photos produced will be accepted by any government agency. Requirements may change without notice. Always verify current photo requirements with the relevant authority before submission.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to use Filekrush for any unlawful purpose, to process illegal content, or to attempt to interfere with the operation of the site. Automated scraping or excessive automated use of the tools is not permitted.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The Filekrush name, logo, and website design are the property of Filekrush. The tools use open-source libraries which retain their respective licenses. You may not copy, reproduce, or redistribute the site or its tools without permission.</p>

      <h2>Advertisements</h2>
      <p>Filekrush may display third-party advertisements. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of advertisers. Clicking on ads takes you to external sites governed by their own terms and privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Filekrush and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the site or tools, including but not limited to loss of data, rejected applications, or missed deadlines.</p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms, email filekrush@gmail.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
